#. module: orbeon
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:orbeon.field_orbeon_builder__name
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Identifies this specific form (e.g. \"health-record\" or \"claim\").\n"
"        This name can be used in APIs, so we recommend you use only lowercases characters."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"         Identificeert dit specifieke formulier (bijv. \"Gezondheidsdossier\" of \"claim\").\n"
"         Deze naam kan in API's worden gebruikt, dus we raden u aan alleen kleine letters te gebruiken."

